B.DG=new A.jn("notice-library-hours-2026","Library study spaces: exam-week hours","Library","30 OCT 2026","Check sample extended hours and quiet-study guidance.","For this campus prototype, the fictional library study area is available from 08:00 to 21:00 during the sample exam week. Quiet desks are on Level 2, while group discussions use the labelled collaboration room. Keep walkways clear and return borrowed materials to the desk. These hours are illustrative; check official university channels before planning an actual visit.",B.qr)
