B.DL=new A.jn("notice-hackathon-2026","Almaty student hackathon team meetup","Technology","31 OCT 2026","Meet fictional teammates for a campus accessibility challenge.","This sample meetup helps students form teams around a fictional campus accessibility challenge. Discuss an idea, choose a small prototype and divide design, development and presentation tasks. The demonstration meetup is in the Student Space at 14:00. Beginners are welcome. This notice does not register anyone for a real hackathon or represent an official event.",B.K3)
B.DK=new A.jn("notice-career-cv-2026","Prepare your first internship CV","Career","02 NOV 2026","Bring a one-page draft and practise describing your projects.","The fictional Career Services team offers a sample CV review session in Room 105 at 11:00. Students can practise summarising course projects, listing relevant skills and writing clear achievement statements. Bring a one-page draft containing fictional contact information for this exercise. No CV is sent to an employer; this announcement is demonstration data.",B.lS)
B.qv=new A.bf(62408,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.DN=new A.jn("notice-sports-2026","Student sports club open afternoon","Sports","03 NOV 2026","Explore sample badminton, basketball and fitness activities.","Visit the fictional Sports Hall at 15:30 to learn about sample student activities. The demonstration programme includes badminton, basketball and a beginner fitness introduction. Wear comfortable clothes and discuss accessibility needs with the sample service desk. This is a fictional programme for the app and does not confirm access to any real campus facilities.",B.qv)
B.lU=new A.bf(61703,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.DI=new A.jn("notice-accommodation-2026","Accommodation application checklist","Student support","04 NOV 2026","Review a fictional checklist before contacting housing support.","This demonstration checklist explains a sample accommodation enquiry. Prepare your preferred move-in date, study year and questions about shared facilities. The fictional housing desk is in Room 112 and offers guidance from 10:00 to 16:00 on weekdays. Do not upload identity documents through this prototype. Actual accommodation availability and rules must be checked with the university.",B.lU)
B.qk=new A.bf(57948,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.DH=new A.jn("notice-wellbeing-2026","Wellbeing and study-planning drop-in","Wellbeing","05 NOV 2026","Explore sample support for balancing deadlines and student life.","The eighth announcement describes a fictional wellbeing drop-in in Room 108 at 13:00. Students can discuss sample study-planning strategies, taking breaks and finding campus support. The session is an illustration of a campus notice, not a real appointment or counselling service. Open Counselling in Services to read the matching sample support information.",B.qk)
